
## MATH LAB COMPONENTS

### 1. Interactive Function Grapher
- Canvas-based 2D graph with DPR scaling
- Input field for function expression (e.g., "x^2", "sin(x)")
- Preset buttons: x^2, x^3, sin(x), cos(x), 2*x+3, x^2-4, abs(x), 1/x
- MeaningPanel with formulas and concepts
- Responsive canvas with ResizeObserver

### 2. 3D Parabola (y = x²)
- TubeGeometry curve with CatmullRomCurve3
- Red sphere markers along curve
- Yellow focus point sphere
- OrbitControls with auto-rotate
- Responsive 3D container

### 3. Coordinate Geometry 3D
- Three modes: Points & Lines, Plane, Vectors
- Colored spheres (red, blue, green, yellow, purple)
- Lines connecting points
- Transparent plane mesh
- Select dropdown for mode switching

### 4. 3D Mathematical Surfaces
- Six surface types: Saddle, Wave, Ripple, Peak, Plane, Cylinder
- Vertex-colored PlaneGeometry with 80x80 divisions
- Color gradient based on height (z-value)
- Select dropdown for surface type

## CHEMISTRY LAB COMPONENTS

### 1. Interactive Periodic Table 3D
- All 118 elements as 3D boxes with category colors
- Hover tooltip with: symbol, name, atomic mass, category, electron config, valency, ion, density, melting/boiling points, electronegativity
- Click to select and view detailed info panel
- Search by name, symbol, or atomic number
- Filter by broad class (metals, non-metals, metalloids) or specific category
- Auto-rotate option toggle
- Group and period mnemonics
- Color legend with clickable chips

### 2. 3D Molecular Models
- Three molecules: H₂O (bent), CO₂ (linear), CH₄ (tetrahedral)
- Sphere-and-stick representation
- Auto-rotating view
- Select dropdown for molecule type

### 3. 3D Periodic Table View
- Simplified 2D grid of element boxes
- Color-coded by category
- Click for details

## PHYSICS LAB COMPONENTS

### 1. Projectile Motion 3D
- Cannon with adjustable angle and velocity
- Animated ball trajectory with path visualization
- Peak marker (yellow) and landing marker (green)
- Velocity component arrows (vx blue, vy red)
- Results panel: time of flight, max height, range, velocities
- Toggle path and vectors visibility
- Launch button with animation

### 2. Uniform Circular Motion 3D
- Rotating ball on circular path
- Tangential velocity arrow (green)
- Centripetal acceleration arrow (red)
- Adjustable radius and angular speed
- Results: angular velocity, linear speed, centripetal acceleration

### 3. Simple Harmonic Motion 3D
- Oscillating ball with spring visualization
- Real-time displacement-time graph trace
- Adjustable amplitude and frequency
- Results: period, angular frequency, displacement equation

## BIOLOGY LAB COMPONENTS

### 1. 3D Cell Visualization
- Two modes: Animal Cell, Plant Cell
- Animal: sphere membrane, nucleus, mitochondria, ER, Golgi
- Plant: rectangular cell wall, large vacuole, chloroplasts
- Auto-rotating view
- Select dropdown for cell type

### 2. 3D DNA Double Helix
- Two intertwined strands with base pairs
- Color-coded base pairs (A-T red-blue, G-C green-yellow)
- Sugar-phosphate backbone spheres
- Auto-rotating view

